        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(A\\cap B)\\ge 0.55$.\n\nUse the addition rule and $P(A\\cup B)\\le 1$.",
          "worked": "Since $P(A\\cup B)\\le 1$,\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\cap B)&=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cup B)\\\\P(A\\cap B)&=1.55-P(A\\cup B)\\\\P(A\\cap B)&\\ge 1.55-1\\\\P(A\\cap B)&\\ge 0.55.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q41-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
