        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(\\overline{A}\\cup\\overline{B})\\le 0.45$.\n\nThis event is the complement of $A\\cap B$; use part (a).",
          "worked": "$\\overline{A}\\cup\\overline{B}$ is the complement of $A\\cap B$. Using part (a),\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\overline{A}\\cup\\overline{B})&=1-P(A\\cap B)\\\\P(\\overline{A}\\cup\\overline{B})&\\le 1-0.55\\\\P(\\overline{A}\\cup\\overline{B})&\\le 0.45.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
